iSolar EyeBond USB Bridge is an independent implementation inspired by
groove-max/esp-eybond-collector and groove-max/ha-eybond-local.
EyeBond frame layout, discovery strings, parameters and behavior were
cross-checked against those projects. No claim of endorsement is made.

